610/extras/810b91479eda33381ef5a974a991942a.webp?t=1755010634\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821610/extras/ccb7b7537aa91d143acc438453a69960.webp?t=1755010634\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEchoes of the End immerses players in an original, grounded fantasy world brimming with depth and detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tThis character-driven adventure features motion-captured performances, intricately designed character models and stunningly crafted environments, delivering a truly unforgettable and heartfelt experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tExplore the hidden history of Aema, forge unbreakable bonds, and embrace your magical potential as you shape the destiny of a nation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821610/extras/a7041c554c69f9a62c851b929dfc1e17.poster.avif?t=1755010634\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821610/extras/a7041c554c69f9a62c851b929dfc1e17.webm?t=1755010634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821610/extras/a7041c554c69f9a62c851b929dfc1e17.mp4?t=1755010634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
